<title>USA: Watkins-Johnson Co Q4 shr loss with charges.</title>
<headline>Watkins-Johnson Co Q4 shr loss with charges.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>QUARTER ENDING DECEMBER 31:	  1996		   1995</p>
<p> Revenue			     94,168,000	  $96,494,000</p>
<p> Net Income (Loss)		(6,590,000)	    9,389,000</p>
<p> Earnings (Loss) per Share	   (0.77)		   1.04</p>
<p> Shares(a)			    8,508,000	    9,045,000</p>
<p> YEAR ENDING DECEMBER 31		 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Revenue			    438,319,000	  387,031,000</p>
<p> Net Income			   3,034,000	   31,428,000</p>
<p> Earnings per Share			0.36		   3.54</p>
<p> Shares(a)			    8,541,000	    8,875,000</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Average common and common-equivalent shares outstanding for earnings-per-share computation</p>
<p>Q4 1996 net income included pre-tax write-downs of excess and slow-moving inventory and severance costs totaling $11 million.</p>
<p>Firm backlog on December 31, 1996 stood at $228,397,000, compared to the 1995 year-end backlog of $250,276,000.  The portion of the current backlog shippable within 12 months is 92 percent, compared to 97 percent one year ago.</p>
</text>
